  "howto": {
    "what": "装上后 Claude 会用 lark-cli base 命令直接操作飞书多维表格：建表、改字段、读写记录、配视图、做聚合统计、公式与 lookup、表单、仪表盘、workflow 和角色权限。",
    "when": "当你提到 Base、多维表格或 bitable，或给出 /base/ 链接时，它接管这类任务。",
    "say": [
      {
        "text": "把 /base/ 这个链接里的表结构列出来",
        "note": "先解析链接取到 base_token 和 table_id"
      },
      {
        "text": "在这个多维表格里新建一张表，字段是姓名、日期、金额",
        "note": "调用 +base-create 并同时配置初始表结构"
      },
      {
        "text": "统计这张表里每个销售的总金额，列出前 10 名",
        "note": "走 +data-query 聚合查询，不拉原始记录"
      }
    ],
    "source": "llm",
    "content_hash": "sha256:ed3ffccc0594d4d8cdc0a33b77648e5456058577c4b57fbfa60d0456b0fde829",
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_at": "2026-09-30T09:20:59.519Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "After install, Claude operates Feishu Base tables through lark-cli base commands: creating tables and fields, reading and writing records, views, aggregate stats, formula/lookup fields, forms, dashboards, workflows and roles.",
    "when_en": "Triggered when you mention Base, 多维表格 or bitable, or give a /base/ link.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "List the table structure behind this /base/ link",
        "note": "It first resolves the link into base_token and table_id"
      },
      {
        "text": "Create a table in this Base with fields name, date, amount",
        "note": "Runs +base-create and sets the initial schema"
      },
      {
        "text": "Sum amount per sales and list the top 10",
        "note": "Uses +data-query aggregation, not raw records"
      }
    ]
